cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Promptotyping working practice, its templates or its skill, please cite it as below."
title: "Promptotyping"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
abstract: >-
  Promptotyping is a working practice in which research data and their contexts
  are translated, with the help of frontier LLM agents, into research artefacts
  that suit the purposes of the researchers and the ways in which they work. It
  draws on Knowledge Engineering, Context Engineering and Agentic Engineering. This repository holds the
  templates of the project knowledge base with their convention, the knowledge
  base of the practice itself and documented use cases. The Promptotyping skill
  for AI coding agents lives in its own repository, promptotyping-skill.
